    seoTitle: "Government Job Pension Schemes Explained: NPS vs Old Pension Scheme (OPS) vs UPS",
    seoDescription: "Simple, easy-to-understand preparation guide on Government Job Pension Schemes Explained: NPS vs Old Pension Scheme (OPS) vs UPS. Understand syllabus, cut-offs, practice strategies, and official rules.",
