    seoTitle: "How to Prepare Current Affairs for Competitive Exams: Daily Routine & Sources",
    seoDescription: "Simple, easy-to-understand preparation guide on How to Prepare Current Affairs for Competitive Exams: Daily Routine & Sources. Understand syllabus, cut-offs, practice strategies, and official rules.",
